WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.650
This is the end!

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.350
Excode Close!

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:32.940
Spectre, you fought well.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:36.400
I won't let your battle go to waste.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.660
I run Across the universe

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.830
At the speed of light

00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.700
Begin Loading

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:03.460
Open the door of dreams

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:07.030
VRAINS spreads

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:10.110
Believe in myself

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:13.670
VRAINS continues

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:18.950
The circuit draws the future

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:23.020
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:24.620
Access!

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:27.320
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:28.930
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:31.230
Link with my soul

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:34.000
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:35.730
Now Win the Race

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:38.570
Connected world

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:42.070
No matter when

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:45.440
Nothing is impossible

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:49.580
Strive for hope

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:54.150
And ride the wind!

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.700
The Tower of Hanoi will soon be completed.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:18.940
But my archrival Playmaker 
will definitely arrive.

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:25.160
To settle our destiny that's 
lasted for ten years.

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:32.910
My battle with Playmaker may 
have started back then...

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:40.880
Five years ago, in order to kill 
the Ignis - AI with free will...

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:44.880
...I attacked the Cyberse, the 
world that the Ignis created.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.890
Vanish, Cyberse!

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:49.910
Don't let him escape!

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.520
What?  He's cutting the signal?

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:00.930
Track him down.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:04.760
Only that Ignis knows the Cyberse's location!

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:09.610
Revolver, we found a lead on Ignis.

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:14.740
If SOL Technologies captures Ignis, 
the Cyberse will resurrect.

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:18.510
If that happens, our 
efforts will go to waste.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:21.720
We must find him before SOL Technologies.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:24.300
There is another worry.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:27.690
The one known as Playmaker.  
He will interfere.

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:30.530
Is he SOL Technologies's assassin?

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:34.430
No.  They'd be more public about it.

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.440
He blocks us when we try to track him.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:41.070
And he erases all his LINK VRAINS logins.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:44.410
He must be an expert hacker.

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:46.640
The Ignis...

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:52.250
Since that day, we've searched 
for the escaped Ignis.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:58.740
A duelist named Playmaker appeared 
in LINK VRAINS a year ago.

00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:02.530
And he hunted the Knights of Hanoi.

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:07.360
And Playmaker had the Ignis.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:12.310
I never expected Playmaker 
to be the dark horse.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.850
Revolver, you made some wrong decisions.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:21.850
But there's a silver lining.  SOL 
Technologies didn't get Ignis.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:26.640
It won't take long to uncover his identity.

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:30.080
One: He hates us - the Knights of Hanoi.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:34.020
Two: Not many people have Cyberse cards.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:41.570
Three: He'll come to me because 
he wants to battle me.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.880
You're correct.

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:49.040
Let's start preparing for that fight.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:54.780
I told Spectre how to lure out Playmaker.

00:04:54.780 --> 00:05:01.990
Use Blue Angel to confront Playmaker.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.190
This is getting interesting.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:09.660
I think we can use her, Revolver.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:14.460
Playmaker hasn't shown up.

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:18.640
Who are you?  Are you a Knight of Hanoi?

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:23.660
Hello.  Duel world's idol, Blue Angel.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:37.150
Your passion towards Playmaker...

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.860
...has deeply impressed me.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:44.940
I'm a fan of yours.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.680
A passionate fan.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.330
You're obviously lying!

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.340
I'm not lying.

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:58.080
I just want you to defeat Playmaker.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:08.020
That card will open a 
door deep in your heart.

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:11.390
A key that frees your hidden desires.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:15.400
Good luck.

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:20.830
Now that you have that card, it's over.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.640
You can no longer defy me.

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:26.500
I'll end this!

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:30.180
Encode Talker attacks Holly Angel!

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:37.650
Final Encode!

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.760
It seems it went well.

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:03.740
Yes.  Now Playmaker will 
comply with our demands.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:09.210
Ignis must be eliminated from this world.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.320
Does that hurt?

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:15.050
It's the same as killing your own child.

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:22.110
I know how important it is to 
eliminate Ignis and the Cyberse.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:29.870
By using Blue Angel, we 
successfully trapped Playmaker.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:36.870
I only have one objective.  Playmaker's AI.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.850
You think we'll just give it to you?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.770
You'll give it to me.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:47.080
We put a computer virus into 
your sister, Blue Angel.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.780
What?

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.990
Only we can remove the virus.

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:53.800
Why my sister?

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:55.020
For hostage.

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:56.640
Hostage?

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.810
It could've been anyone.

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:02.860
As long as it inflamed Playmaker's 
sense of justice and drew him out.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:06.570
But a no-name wouldn't be effective.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:09.550
That's why we used Blue Angel.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.770
Used Aoi?

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:14.140
Hand over the removal program!

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:16.490
That'll depend on you.

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:20.750
SOL Technologies' Security 
Manager, Akira Zaizen.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:25.590
Your job is to retrieve Ignis.

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:35.020
If you retrieve Ignis, you'll fulfill 
your job for SOL Technologies.  But...

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:40.000
Your sister won't wake up from the 
darkness for the rest of her life.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:45.730
If Playmaker defeats me in a duel, 
I'll give you the removal program.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:50.880
No way!  Entrust my sister's future 
to people who I don't know?

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:53.280
There's only one path.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:57.670
Now choose your sister's future!

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.560
My sister's life is irreplaceable.

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.240
That was horrible.

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:18.600
I'll be waiting for you, Playmaker.

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:29.080
Playmaker, you interfered with us many times.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:33.220
I don't care who you are.

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:36.820
There are many in the world who hate us.

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:39.070
And you're just another one.

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:41.970
We only have one goal.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.270
To retrieve the Ignis!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:45.770
Ignis?

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:50.700
You acquired that AI without 
knowing what it is?

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:53.030
Don't worry about me.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:57.440
When Playmaker wins, I'll eat your program!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:00.440
And get my body back!

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:01.410
Fine.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:04.640
But if I win, you're mine.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.320
Okay, Playmaker?

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:07.150
Yeah.

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:11.250
The winner acquires everything, 
the loser loses everything.

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:12.830
That's competition.

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:17.030
Looks like you didn't bring your support AI.

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:19.640
I don't trust AI.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:22.780
The internet world is a fiction.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:26.020
What's important are the 
breath and heartbeat of life.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.210
But people are misled by 
fake user-friendliness

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:33.180
and bonds, entrusting their 
souls to this fiction.

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:35.920
Not realizing this folly 
will destroy the world!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.120
What's with him?

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:41.290
He's a hacker, but he 
criticizes the internet?

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.660
Is he anti-modern?

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.620
Ignis will lead us to destruction!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:48.360
Since you're helping him, you're also guilty!

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:51.100
Sorry, but I need you gone.

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:56.630
I'll create a stage fitting for our battle.

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:02.180
W-What's this?

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.880
It's like hell.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:09.350
Here we go!  The hellish duel now begins!

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.360
Let's go!

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:15.450
W-What's this?

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:17.760
I used your power to my advantage.

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:20.240
So you planned for all this?

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:21.590
Exactly.

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:26.700
A Speed Duel is too limiting for our fight.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:30.080
The next stage is waiting for us.

00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:31.540
Yusaku!

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:44.650
We successfully lured out Playmaker.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:53.860
In order to guarantee victory, the duel 
switched from a Speed Duel to a Master Duel.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:58.370
It's the center of the 
Data Storm.  It's quiet.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.040
This is his field.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:10.440
You arrived, Playmaker.

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:13.850
This is the scene for our new battle.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:22.950
We will settle this in a Master Duel.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:24.920
Master Duel...

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:31.900
In a Master Duel, the Monster Zone and Spell 
& Trap Zones are bigger than in a Speed Duel.

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:38.890
The true power of a Link Monster's Link 
Markers can only be unleashed in a Master Duel.

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:43.750
Now you and I can fully use our powers.

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:46.980
Fine.  I will finish you here.

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:55.850
What's that card?

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:58.370
A card to power up his Master Duel.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:03.470
It's true that Speed Duel and Master Duel 
strategies are completely different.

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:04.700
Let's do this.

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:07.340
Duel!

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:11.610
I'll go first.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:15.700
I activate the Field Spell, Fire Prison.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:26.810
When I heard three things from Playmaker, 
I knew he was my opponent of destiny.

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:32.890
An opponent who hasn't forgotten 
a single day for ten years.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.420
No, I won't lose.

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:39.400
I have three reasons why I must defeat you!

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:46.250
#1: I'll defeat you and uncover the 
truth about what happened ten years ago!

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:51.840
#2: I'll regain the time that I lost!

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:56.450
#3: I'll save my friend who saved me!

00:13:56.450 --> 00:14:00.090
Ten years ago...  Three things...

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:03.690
You're the one from that 
incident ten years ago?

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:08.790
That's right.  I'm that emissary of revenge!

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:15.880
Ten years ago, for my father 
Dr. Kogami's Lost Incident...

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:20.010
...Playmaker was one of the 
six kidnapped children.

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:28.210
Ten years later, the child in that 
experiment returned to confront us as Playmaker.

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:31.840
How can this not be destiny?

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:57.910
This power...  A new fight is beginning.

00:14:58.380 --> 00:14:59.710
Yes.

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:09.590
When this seed bears Hanoi's fruit, that's the 
end of LINK VRAINS- No, the whole network world.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:15.830
To achieve this long-cherished 
desire, I resurrected from the dead.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:29.210
Our plan proceeded to the next stage.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:33.310
But I was still obsessed with Playmaker.

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:40.300
Compared to the noble cause I was facing, 
I knew my obsession was trivial.

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:45.490
But I was obsessed with uncovering 
Playmaker's identity.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:51.320
If Hanoi's program activates, the Lost 
Incident's records will be erased.

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:54.770
And I'll never know Playmaker's identity.

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:59.200
The plan is coming together.

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:02.210
So Hanoi's program will...

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:05.220
Soon be complete.  And then...

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:06.880
Yes.

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:09.880
What's wrong?  What's with the long face?

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.800
I want a little time.

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:14.350
Time?  For what?

00:16:14.350 --> 00:16:16.880
I want to settle things with someone.

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:18.730
You mean Playmaker.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:28.110
I can't move on if I still lost to him.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:31.790
I see.  But I can't wait for long.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:33.100
Understood.

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:41.540
Over a thousand people have joined the 
Knights of Hanoi, but they're mostly hoodlums.

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:46.680
They're only infatuated with 
Hanoi for opposing LINK VRAINS.

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:49.930
They're only it for self-promotion.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:54.890
They tarnish the Knights 
of Hanoi's reputation.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:56.860
You came.

00:16:57.390 --> 00:17:00.610
Now is the time to carry 
out Dr. Kogami's wishes.

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:04.570
Our mission is to kill the Ignis.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:07.570
Dr. Genome is already making his move.

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:10.450
We gave him the Data Gale.

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:17.680
My obsession may have led the 
three knights to tragedy.

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:23.800
They started to worry because 
I spent too much time on him.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:30.320
If the Tower of Hanoi is created, I'll 
become one of the biggest criminals in history.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:37.130
So they challenged Playmaker so I 
wouldn't have to carry that burden.

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:42.410
The first victim was Genome.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:46.280
This is the end!

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:48.140
The Master Ogre!

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:51.850
Go!  Attack Gothiclone!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:15.100
You'll regret defeating me.

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:22.190
Baira was the second knight to fall.

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:30.720
Is it because she hasn't given up hope?

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:34.930
Her will not to give up 
has created a miracle.

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:44.220
Battle!  Trickstar Bella Madonna 
attacks Dark Mummy Surgical Forceps!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:47.070
Shining Espoir!

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:50.080
This is the power of believing!

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:02.840
And then Faust.

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:06.160
The next strike will end you, Faust!

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:08.570
Listen to me, Playmaker!

00:19:09.490 --> 00:19:12.780
That Ignis...  Humanity's future-

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:16.330
Playmaker!  Let's finish him.

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:19.070
Battle!

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:23.660
Powercode Talker attacks 
Motor Worm Spreader Queen!

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:26.830
Powercode Talker's additional effect!

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:33.250
I tribute Space Insulator that's next to 
its link to double Powercode Talker's ATK!

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:34.540
Break through!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.930
Power Termination Smash!

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:50.340
Playmaker, due to your own hands, 
humanity's future will be...

00:19:55.160 --> 00:20:00.840
They fell because I was 
obsessed with Playmaker.

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:08.200
So...

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:13.660
Were you able to uncover 
Playmaker's identity?

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:15.660
No.

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:28.740
Since we started the Tower of Hanoi...

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:33.480
...you no longer need to be obsessed 
with Playmaker's identity.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:37.400
Kusanagi!

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:38.800
Yusaku.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:41.850
What's that?

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:48.620
When this plan is over and the 
people learn of our crime...

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:54.510
...they may say our motivation was 
to get revenge on SOL Technologies.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:21:00.020
But I believe they will 
eventually learn the truth.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:03.370
Our goal is to kill the Ignis.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:09.180
No matter how many victims we create, 
we must accomplish this goal.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:19.250
We're the only ones who currently understand 
what it truly means for an AI to have free will.

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:23.300
The plan will soon be complete.

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:28.600
Those trapped in the Tower of 
Hanoi can no longer escape.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:34.740
Once the Tower of Hanoi is completed, all 
the data in the world will be destroyed.

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:42.500
The Tower of Hanoi will soon be completed.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:46.520
Playmaker will definitely arrive before then.

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:49.640
This is our destiny.

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.660
We are prisoners of destiny.

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:55.380
We can't escape it.

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:58.320
This is our final duel.

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:02.900
I promise to defeat Playmaker.

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:15.270
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:22.410
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:29.640
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:36.990
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:37.840 --> 00:22:44.230
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:44.620 --> 00:22:48.400
There were fragments of power

00:22:48.620 --> 00:22:55.570
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:55.800 --> 00:23:02.910
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:10.090
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:10.340 --> 00:23:17.320
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:24.170
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:24.890 --> 00:23:31.870
